                <p class="text-[#2F3B40] text-center">Patent rights protect your technology exclusively for 20 years and prevent unauthorized use by others.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="service-card p-6">
                <div class="service-icon"><i class="fas fa-rocket"></i></div>
                <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-center mb-3 text-[#0F172A]">Investment Attraction</h3>
