<!-- 출원 절차 -->
<section class="py-16 bg-white">
    <div class="container mx-auto">
        <% if (lang === 'en') { %>
        <h2 class="section-title text-3xl font-bold text-center">Patent / Utility Model Application Process</h2>
        <p class="text-center text-[#2F3B40] mb-12">We help you secure firm rights through a systematic and professional process.</p>
        <div class="space-y-8">
            <div class="process-step p-8 ml-8"><div class="process-number">1</div><h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-3 text-[#0F172A]">Invention Consultation &amp; Review</h3><p class="text-[#2F3B40]">Through a free consultation, we analyze your invention and conduct a primary patentability review to establish the optimal filing strategy.</p></div>
            <div class="process-step p-8 ml-8"><div class="process-number">2</div><h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-3 text-[#0F172A]">Prior Art Search</h3><p class="text-[#2F3B40]">We precisely search domestic and international patent databases to analyze similar technologies and suggest design-around strategies to improve registration prospects.</p></div>
            <div class="process-step p-8 ml-8"><div class="process-number">3</div><h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-3 text-[#0F172A]">Drafting Application Documents</h3><p class="text-[#2F3B40]">Based on a deep understanding of the technology, we draft the specification and design claims to optimize the scope of rights for a strong patent.</p></div>
            <div class="process-step p-8 ml-8"><div class="process-number">4</div><h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-3 text-[#0F172A]">Filing &amp; Examination Response</h3><p class="text-[#2F3B40]">We promptly submit documents to the KIPO to secure the filing date, then actively respond to any rejections with arguments and amendments.</p></div>
            <div class="process-step p-8 ml-8"><div class="process-number">5</div><h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-3 text-[#0F172A]">Registration &amp; Post-Registration Management</h3><p class="text-[#2F3B40]">After final registration and issuance of the patent certificate, we provide ongoing management including annuity payment and rights utilization consulting.</p></div>
        </div>
        <% } else { %>
        <h2 class="section-title text-3xl font-bold text-center">특허/실용신안 출원 절차</h2>
        <p class="text-center text-[#2F3B40] mb-12">체계적이고 전문적인 절차로 확실한 권리 확보를 도와드립니다</p>
        <div class="space-y-8">
            <div class="process-step p-8 ml-8"><div class="process-number">1</div><h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-3 text-[#0F172A]">발명 상담 및 검토</h3><p class="text-[#2F3B40]">무료 상담을 통해 발명 내용을 분석하고, 특허 가능성을 1차 검토하여 최적의 출원 전략을 수립합니다.</p></div>
            <div class="process-step p-8 ml-8"><div class="process-number">2</div><h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-3 text-[#0F172A]">선행기술조사</h3><p class="text-[#2F3B40]">국내외 특허 데이터베이스를 정밀 검색하여 유사 기술을 분석하고, 등록 가능성을 높이기 위한 회피 설계 방안을 제시합니다.</p></div>
            <div class="process-step p-8 ml-8"><div class="process-number">3</div><h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-3 text-[#0F172A]">출원서류 작성</h3><p class="text-[#2F3B40]">기술에 대한 깊은 이해를 바탕으로 명세서를 작성하고, 권리범위를 최적화하여 강력한 특허를 확보할 수 있도록 청구항을 설계합니다.</p></div>
            <div class="process-step p-8 ml-8"><div class="process-number">4</div><h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-3 text-[#0F172A]">출원 및 심사대응</h3><p class="text-[#2F3B40]">특허청에 신속하게 서류를 제출하여 출원일을 확보하고, 심사 과정에서 발생하는 거절이유에 대해 의견서와 보정서로 적극 대응합니다.</p></div>
            <div class="process-step p-8 ml-8"><div class="process-number">5</div><h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-3 text-[#0F172A]">등록 및 사후관리</h3><p class="text-[#2F3B40]">최종 등록 후 특허증을 발급받고, 연차료 관리, 권리 활용 컨설팅 등 지속적인 사후 관리를 제공합니다.</p></div>
        </div>
        <% } %>
    </div>
</section>

